<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:5fbfec11-a18a-4268-b140-cd83bd83310e" title="Web Q&amp;A" data-linktype="external">Web Q&amp;A:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:5fbfec11-a18a-4268-b140-cd83bd83310e" title="XML Data Islands, Updategrams, Stored Procedures, and More" data-linktype="external">XML Data Islands, Updategrams, Stored Procedures, and More</a></p>
